---
import '../../styles/coverage.css';
---

<section class="coverage-section section-pad">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading centered">
      <p class="label muted">Rs.99 first step</p>
      <h2>What the Stream Clarity Webinar covers</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="coverage-grid">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-index">01</span>
        <h3>Stream selection framework</h3>
        <p>Understand how Science, Commerce, and Humanities should be compared beyond Class 10 marks.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-index">02</span>
        <h3>Aptitude indicators</h3>
        <p>See how logical, numerical, verbal, and spatial strengths can point toward different study paths.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-index">03</span>
        <h3>Parent-child alignment</h3>
        <p>Learn how to reduce confusion when the child wants one path and the parent is worried about another.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-index">04</span>
        <h3>NEP subject flexibility</h3>
        <p>Discuss how subject combinations and emerging career clusters can be evaluated with more nuance.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
